      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "NAS metrics require the local monitoring account on each console. An empty NAS panel means telemetry is unavailable. Backup collection runs every five minutes and preserves previously verified timestamps during failures; check its age. Repository busy is distinct from a backup failure. UniFi Drive cloud-backup job success and snapshot age are not collected. The NAS filter applies to storage panels; Borg verification is the NUC-wide backup workflow."
